[00:01.50]December 24,
[00:03.50]Jack
[00:04.91]I feel most embarrassed about referring to a rather difficult subject.
[00:10.58]I wonder if it may have slipped your mind that nearly three months ago you asked me for a loan of RMB 500.
[00:19.64]You said you would pay me back on the next payday.
[00:22.15]Is it possible that you pay it back within 2 weeks?
[00:26.58]I am sure you will agree and not be offended by my request.
[00:31.64]Here is a piece of good news for you.
[00:34.77]The Russian State Ballet,
[00:36.14]which is now on tour in Beijing,
[00:38.95]will give a performance in the National Center for the Performing Arts tomorrow evening.
[00:43.03]I am sure you will be happy to watch it.
[00:47.18]Here I leave you a ticket.
[00:50.24]The performance will begin at seven o’clock sharp.
[00:54.88]I will expect you at the theater entrance.
[00:57.55]Please let me know if you can’t make it.
[00:59.80]Yours sincerely, Li Ming
[ti:1-07-便条]